translation.compliance.evidence.outcomeRow.noSurface.detail	A current scan of this profile declared that none of the sources it scanned can speak to this control, and no current scan recorded a search for it. This says nothing about whether the control is met.
translation.compliance.evidence.outcomeRow.noSurface.next	Check other sources for policies, procedures, training records, or operational configuration relevant to this control. Within the current scan scope, no source was searched for it.
translation.compliance.evidence.outcomeRow.noEvidence.detail	The current scans searched their sources for this control, and it currently has no open evidence or deviations. Having no open findings is not evidence that the control is met; the matchers may also have missed evidence kept in another form.
translation.compliance.evidence.outcomeRow.noEvidence.next	Check whether the control is implemented or documented outside the searched sources, and add that evidence alongside the scans.
translation.compliance.evidence.outcomeRow.notSearched.detail	The current scans have no recorded search for this criterion. Older scans may not include search details.
translation.compliance.evidence.outcomeRow.notSearched.next	Run a new scan to check this criterion.
translation.compliance.evidence.outcomeRow.noScans.detail	No completed scan results are loaded for this profile, so nothing is known about this control from the repositories.
translation.compliance.evidence.outcomeRow.noScans.next	Run a new scan of the system's repositories to search for this control.
